# Technical SEO — desktop

Same URL as mobile. PSI/Lighthouse **Desktop**.

| Metric | Target | Tactics |
|--------|--------|---------|
| LCP | ≤2.5s | `LcpImagePreload` + hero `srcSet`/`sizes="58vw"`; `lcpHeroImageProps()` up to 1200w; `fetchPriority="high"` |
| INP | ≤200ms | rAF scroll with deduped state; carousel sentinels; light flyout handlers |
| CLS | ≤0.1 | stable sticky header; explicit image width/height |

Nav links in HTML (`lg:flex`); keyboard dropdowns + `:focus-visible`; breadcrumbs on detail pages; `motion-reduce` on hover transforms.

**1440px Urdu check (actionable):** open a leaf + homepage at ≥1440px width — titles must not clip, sticky header must not overlap H1, no unintended horizontal scroll, card grids stay 3-col without overflow.

Also verify **375** and **768** before shipping layout work (`18-mobile-first-responsive.mdc` checklist).

Leaf pages: `leafHeroImageUrl()` at 1200w · `next/image` with `fetchPriority="high"` for above-the-fold heroes.

